# DEBATE WITH NUMBERS (OWNER 2026-08-24)

Bobby is not the market researcher. Agents are.

When he opens a strategy / money / market debate:

1. Write **his cheap reason** as the hypothesis.
2. Fetch **this-turn** benchmarks. Run a **6-month** (or same-window) model of both funnels. Name sources. Label assumptions.
3. **Close with one recommended package.** Do not ask him price / currency / fork until that table exists.
4. Constraints (Play Families, law) go in the model as facts, not as questions to him.
5. Write the debate into canon the same sitting. Chat is not storage.

